# Architecture: Caddy Reverse Proxy & NGINX Gateway Fabric Integration

Guide explaining edge traffic ingestion, TLS termination, and L7 routing through Caddy and the Kubernetes Gateway API.

---

## 1. Edge Ingress Flow Architecture

In the `k8s-homelab` cluster, edge routing separates public/edge TLS termination from in-cluster Kubernetes L7 microservice routing:

```text
External Client
      │
      ▼  (HTTPS :443)
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Caddy Edge Ingress (kube-control-plane)               │
│  - DNS-01 ACME automated TLS certificates (PowerDNS)   │
│  - Handles *.k8s-pre.os76.xyz / *.k8s.os76.xyz         │
│  - Reverse proxy upstream to Worker NodePorts          │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
      │
      ▼  (HTTP :30080 or HTTPS :30443)
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  NGINX Gateway Fabric (worker nodes)                   │
│  - Implements Kubernetes Gateway API standard CRDs     │
│  - Gateway: cka-lab-gateway                            │
│  - HTTPRoute: cka-lab-httproute                        │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
      │
      ├── /httpbin/* ──► Service: httpbingo:80 (httpbin-go)
      └── /api/*     ──► Service: cka-lab-ingress-api-svc:80
```

---

## 2. In-Cluster Gateway API Configuration

### The Gateway Resource

The `Gateway` resource declares the entry points and ports managed by the Gateway controller (`gatewayClassName: nginx`):

```yaml
apiVersion: gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: Gateway
metadata:
  name: cka-lab-gateway
spec:
  gatewayClassName: nginx
  listeners:
    - name: http
      port: 80
      protocol: HTTP
      allowedRoutes:
        namespaces:
          from: All
```

### The HTTPRoute Resource

The `HTTPRoute` attaches to `parentRefs: cka-lab-gateway` and defines granular path matching and rewrite filters:

```yaml
apiVersion: gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: HTTPRoute
metadata:
  name: cka-lab-httproute
spec:
  parentRefs:
    - name: cka-lab-gateway
  rules:
    - matches:
        - path:
            type: PathPrefix
            value: /httpbin
      filters:
        - type: URLRewrite
          urlRewrite:
            path:
              type: ReplacePrefixMatch
              replacePrefixMatch: /
      backendRefs:
        - name: httpbingo
          port: 80
```

